title Klondike: hidden and shown again by the launcher (the clock is paused, the table is intact)
sizes 640x480 480x800
lifecycle
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DATA p-life
env KLONDIKE_TEST_RESET 1
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DEAL 1
env KLONDIKE_TEST_PROBES 1
wait 300
tap "@S"
wait 400
expect text "Moves 3"
hide
expect hidden
wait 1500
show
expect visible
wait 400
expect repaint
shot shown
check shown
expect text "Moves 3"
tap "@S"
wait 300
expect text "Moves 4"
close
